---
// What a contractor gets after Jesse takes a call. The caller is made up.
---
<figure class="reveal">
  <div class="panel !rounded-[22px] text-charcoal shadow-[0_30px_60px_-30px_rgba(120,60,10,0.45)]">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-4 bg-tint text-[14px] font-medium text-charcoal">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><span class="dot-live"></span> New call, 7:42 PM</span>
      <span class="text-pencil">from Jesse</span>
    </div>
    <div class="px-6 pt-5 pb-2">
      <p class="font-display font-bold text-[20px] tracking-tight leading-snug">Water coming through the kitchen ceiling after the storm</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="px-6 pb-6 text-[15px]">
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 py-2.5 border-b border-charcoal/10">
        <dt class="w-20 shrink-0 note">Caller</dt>
        <dd>Dana Whitfield</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 py-2.5 border-b border-charcoal/10">
        <dt class="w-20 shrink-0 note">Number</dt>
        <dd>(217) 555-0142</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 py-2.5 border-b border-charcoal/10">
        <dt class="w-20 shrink-0 note">Needs</dt>
        <dd>Roof leak over the kitchen. Shingles missing on the back slope. Wants a tarp tonight and a repair quote.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4 py-2.5 border-b border-charcoal/10">
        <dt class="w-20 shrink-0 note">Job site</dt>
        <dd>1418 Linden Ave</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4 pt-3 items-center">
        <dt class="w-20 shrink-0 note">Urgency</dt>
        <dd><span class="inline-block bg-signal text-ink font-semibold text-[13px] rounded-full px-3 py-1">Tonight</span></dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="mt-5 text-[14px] text-pencil text-center">An example of the email Jesse sends you after a call.</figcaption>
</figure>
